[AUTOMATA][EMAIL] Triage support emails and schedule SLA tasks with Gmail, Gemini, Google Calendar, 	t	[{"id": "7ffd5c10-6afc-4082-80a1-ba4bf494f58b", "name": "Sticky Note", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [528, 544], "parameters": {"width": 560, "height": 980, "content": "## Customer Support Triage & SLA Calendar Dispatcher\\n\\nAutomate incoming customer inquiry triage from Gmail with Google Gemini. The system classifies requests, calculates dynamic SLA deadlines based on urgency, schedules follow-up blocks in Google Calendar, logs ticket records in Google Sheets, generates AI reply drafts, and sends instant Discord alerts for high-priority incidents.\\n\\nWho's it for: Customer support leads, IT service desks, and operations teams needing automated triage and SLA tracking without manual data entry.\\n\\n### How it works\\n1. When Email Arrives polls unread emails with the subject \\"Inquiry Received\\".\\n2. Language Model Processing and Gemini parse the email body into structured JSON (priority, category, summary, draft).\\n3. Calculate SLA & Deadlines computes resolution target times (High: 4h, Medium: 1 day, Low: 3 days).\\n4. Add to Google Calendar creates a deadline block, Append Details to Sheets logs the record, and Create Gmail Draft saves a reply.\\n5. If priority is High, Check Priority Level routes a critical alert to Send Urgent Discord Alert.\\n\\n### Setup\\n1. Connect your Gmail, Google Gemini, Google Calendar, and Google Sheets credentials.\\n2. Prepare a Google Sheet titled `form` with headers: received_at, priority, category, sender, subject, summary, deadline, calendar_event_url.\\n3. Configure your Discord Webhook URL in Send Urgent Discord Alert.\\n\\n### Customization tips\\n- Adjust dynamic SLA hours directly in the JavaScript code inside Calculate SLA & Deadlines.\\n- Modify the prompt in Language Model Processing to adapt categorization tags to your domain."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "fb7737b5-91a9-4055-adb5-846f738db3bb", "name": "Sticky Note1", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [1152, 640], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 576, "height": 528, "content": "## 1. Receive and classify email\\n\\nCaptures new support emails from Gmail and uses the LLM chain, Gemini chat model, and structured parser to extract triage details in a predictable format."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "29e8d2f4-9b4d-4731-b52a-43897c618700", "name": "Sticky Note2", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [1760, 576], "parameters": {"color": 7, "height": 384, "content": "## 2. Calculate SLA deadlines\\n\\nUses custom code to convert the structured triage output into SLA dates, deadlines, and priority metadata before splitting into downstream actions."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "bfa71d6d-87bb-42fa-84b0-0f4e9f0f65b8", "name": "Sticky Note3", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [2032, 544], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 672, "height": 320, "content": "## 3. Schedule and draft response\\n\\nCreates a Google Calendar item for the SLA follow-up, logs the triaged case in Google Sheets, and prepares a Gmail draft response for the support team."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "3e0a6b69-a4d9-4c81-a696-27ff6a705c4f", "name": "Sticky Note4", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [1888, 1056], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 496, "height": 320, "content": "## 4. Send urgent alerts\\n\\nChecks whether the calculated priority meets the urgent criteria and sends a Discord notification for cases that need immediate attention."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "52442285-2764-4448-bb68-ec21d13ca212", "name": "When Email Arrives", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger", "position": [1200, 800], "parameters": {"filters": {"q": "subject:\\"Inquiry Received\\"", "readStatus": "unread"}, "pollTimes": {"item": [{"mode": "everyMinute"}]}}, "typeVersion": 1.1}, {"id": "93ba0cca-4034-4ca1-be14-a69a88f25487", "name": "Language Model Processing", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm", "position": [1424, 800], "parameters": {"text": "=Please analyze the following incoming customer inquiry email and return the result strictly in the specified JSON schema.\\n\\n[Sender]: {{ $json.from?.text || $json.from?.value?.[0]?.address || $json.from || '' }}\\n[Subject]: {{ $json.subject || '' }}\\n[Body]: {{ $json.text || $json.snippet || '' }}", "promptType": "define", "hasOutputParser": true}, "typeVersion": 1.5}, {"id": "943fd210-b232-4263-abe1-1ff5550ba02e", "name": "Gemini AI Conversation", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini", "position": [1344, 1024], "parameters": {"options": {}}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "5c1b7355-acca-406f-8ad2-c41a157edd3f", "name": "Parse Structured Output", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured", "position": [1504, 1024], "parameters": {"schemaType": "manual", "inputSchema": "{\\n  \\"type\\": \\"object\\",\\n  \\"properties\\": {\\n    \\"category\\": {\\n      \\"type\\": \\"string\\",\\n      \\"description\\": \\"Category of inquiry: Billing, Technical, Account, or Other\\"\\n    },\\n    \\"priority\\": {\\n      \\"type\\": \\"string\\",\\n      \\"enum\\": [\\"High\\", \\"Medium\\", \\"Low\\"],\\n      \\"description\\": \\"Urgency level of the customer email\\"\\n    },\\n    \\"summary\\": {\\n      \\"type\\": \\"string\\",\\n      \\"description\\": \\"Concise summary of the inquiry within 1-2 sentences\\"\\n    },\\n    \\"reply_draft\\": {\\n      \\"type\\": \\"string\\",\\n      \\"description\\": \\"Professional and polite email reply draft\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\"required\\": [\\n    \\"category\\",\\n    \\"priority\\",\\n    \\"summary\\",\\n    \\"reply_draft\\"\\n  ]\\n}"}, "typeVersion": 1.2}, {"id": "32c45b12-1d9d-4775-a1d8-dc10a0c8f2c0", "name": "Calculate SLA & Deadlines", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "position": [1808, 800], "parameters": {"jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\\nconst gmail = $('When Email Arrives').first().json;\\n\\n// Extract structured outputs from LangChain node\\nconst priority = item.output?.priority || item.priority || 'Medium';\\nconst category = item.output?.category || item.category || 'General Inquiry';\\nconst summary = item.output?.summary || item.summary || '';\\nconst replyDraft = item.output?.reply_draft || item.reply_draft || '';\\n\\n// Robust extraction for sender and subject\\nconst sender = \\n  gmail.from?.text || \\n  gmail.from?.value?.[0]?.address || \\n  gmail.From || \\n  gmail.from || \\n  gmail.sender || \\n  '';\\n\\nconst subject = \\n  gmail.subject || \\n  gmail.Subject || \\n  'Customer Inquiry';\\n\\nconst threadId = gmail.threadId || gmail.thread_id || '';\\nconst messageId = gmail.id || '';\\n\\nconst now = new Date();\\nlet deadline = new Date(now);\\n\\n// Dynamic SLA Logic\\nif (priority === 'High') {\\n  deadline.setHours(deadline.getHours() + 4);\\n} else if (priority === 'Medium') {\\n  deadline.setDate(deadline.getDate() + 1);\\n  deadline.setHours(18, 0, 0, 0);\\n} else {\\n  deadline.setDate(deadline.getDate() + 3);\\n  deadline.setHours(18, 0, 0, 0);\\n}\\n\\n// Format local date string (JST)\\nconst formatLocalDate = (date) => {\\n  const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');\\n  return `${date.getFullYear()}-${pad(date.getMonth() + 1)}-${pad(date.getDate())} ${pad(date.getHours())}:${pad(date.getMinutes())}:${pad(date.getSeconds())}`;\\n};\\n\\nreturn [{\\n  json: {\\n    priority: priority,\\n    category: category,\\n    summary: summary,\\n    replyDraft: replyDraft,\\n    sender: sender,\\n    subject: subject,\\n    threadId: threadId,\\n    messageId: messageId,\\n    startTime: now.toISOString(),\\n    deadlineTime: deadline.toISOString(),\\n    deadlineDisplay: formatLocalDate(deadline),\\n    taskTitle: `[Action Required / ${priority}] ${category}: ${subject}`\\n  }\\n}];"}, "typeVersion": 2}, {"id": "e6cbcbc8-c351-401d-a850-fd45c0532db8", "name": "Add to Google Calendar", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar", "position": [2080, 704], "parameters": {"end": "={{ $json.deadlineTime }}", "start": "={{ $json.startTime }}", "calendar": {"__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "primary", "cachedResultName": "primary"}, "additionalFields": {"summary": "={{ $json.taskTitle }}", "description": "=【Inquiry Summary】\\n{{ $json.summary }}\\n\\n【Priority & SLA】\\nPriority: {{ $json.priority }}\\nDeadline: {{ $json.deadlineDisplay }}\\n\\n【Ticket Details】\\nSender: {{ $json.sender }}\\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\\nThread ID: {{ $json.threadId }}"}}, "typeVersion": 1.2}, {"id": "cdc6eaf4-d10f-4c1b-9892-38faffcff5b8", "name": "Append Details to Sheets", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "position": [2320, 704], "parameters": {"columns": {"value": {"sender": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.sender }}", "subject": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.subject }}", "summary": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.summary }}", "category": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.category }}", "deadline": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.deadlineDisplay }}", "priority": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.priority }}", "received_at": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}", "calendar_event_url": "={{ $json.htmlLink || '' }}"}, "mappingMode": "defineBelow"}, "options": {}, "operation": "append", "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "mode": "name", "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_NAME"}, "documentId": {"__rl": true, "mode": "id", "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_ID"}}, "typeVersion": 4.5}, {"id": "38488330-c559-42fa-b24c-a98d5f6c7e47", "name": "Create Gmail Draft", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail", "position": [2560, 704], "webhookId": "db8109dd-02af-4df0-ab49-2a98cdab56e0", "parameters": {"message": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.replyDraft }}", "options": {"threadId": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.threadId }}"}, "subject": "=Re: {{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.subject }}", "resource": "draft"}, "typeVersion": 2.1}, {"id": "e64f79d7-ef1f-4342-9dcc-ce9eb9bf17b4", "name": "Check Priority Level", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "position": [1936, 1232], "parameters": {"options": {}, "conditions": {"options": {"version": 2, "leftValue": "", "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict"}, "combinator": "and", "conditions": [{"id": "priority-high-condition", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}, "leftValue": "={{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.priority }}", "rightValue": "High"}]}}, "typeVersion": 2.2}, {"id": "65f503b8-62e6-4cc3-8888-22de57ce905f", "name": "Send Urgent Discord Alert", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord", "position": [2240, 1216], "webhookId": "cafcef01-93d0-4b71-86f6-83f344cfae92", "parameters": {"content": "=🚨 **[Critical Customer Alert / High Priority]**\\n\\n- **Deadline**: {{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.deadlineDisplay }}\\n- **Category**: {{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.category }}\\n- **Sender**: {{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.sender }}\\n- **Subject**: {{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.subject }}\\n\\n**Summary**:\\n{{ $('Calculate SLA & Deadlines').item.json.summary }}\\n\\n*(Draft reply has been generated in Gmail. Please verify immediately.)*", "options": {}, "authentication": "webhook"}, "typeVersion": 2}, {"id": "webhook-automata-injected-1791111459406", "name": "Automata Webhook", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", "position": [0, 0], "webhookId": "F3h54irwGJxhM2yU", "parameters": {"path": "F3h54irwGJxhM2yU", "options": {}, "httpMethod": "POST", "responseCode": 200, "responseMode": "onReceived"}, "typeVersion": 1.1}]	{"When Email Arrives":{"main":[[{"node":"Language Model Processing","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Check Priority Level":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Urgent Discord Alert","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Add to Google Calendar":{"main":[[{"node":"Append Details to Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Gemini AI Conversation":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Language Model Processing","type"