jdJ8ykB7-5W2qNxpyMMVqdUg", "cachedResultUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/18HTzdkvuVmXZbiT--jIjdJ8ykB7-5W2qNxpyMMVqdUg/edit?usp=drivesdk", "cachedResultName": "FLOW AI Angebote"}}, "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "cbc1b5f60f3e43a0", "name": "Dummy googleSheetsOAuth2Api"}}, "typeVersion": 4.7}, {"id": "0756ba3e-9fa5-48fb-855a-3b4a6323b3f7", "name": "README - Template setup", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [0, 0], "parameters": {"color": 2, "width": 600, "height": 1048, "content": "## Generate and send quote PDFs with OpenAI, Gmail and Google Sheets\\n\\nAutomate the path from an incoming customer quote request to a structured draft, supplier-price comparison, approved PDF quote, and customer email.\\n\\n### How it works\\n1. Read quote requests and optional PDF attachments from Gmail.\\n2. Extract customer and project details with OpenAI.\\n3. Save quote drafts and supplier requests in Google Sheets.\\n4. Send approved supplier price requests through Gmail.\\n5. Parse and compare incoming supplier offers with OpenAI.\\n6. Generate the approved quote, PDF, Drive link, and email.\\n\\n### Setup\\n1. Connect **Gmail**, **Google Sheets**, **Google Drive**, and **OpenAI** credentials.\\n2. Replace the Google Sheet references with your own workbook.\\n3. Create these tabs: `Tabellenblatt1`, `Haendleranfragen`, `Haendlerangebote`, `Haendlervergleiche`.\\n4. Keep the column names used by the Google Sheets nodes unchanged, or update every mapping consistently.\\n5. Review the Gmail sender text, recipient fields, OpenAI prompts, and Google Drive destination.\\n6. Test with sample data before activating all triggers.\\n\\n### Important\\nThe customer quote is sent only after its sheet status is changed to `FREIGEGEBEN`. Supplier price requests use the same approval pattern before sending.\\n\\n### Customization\\nAdapt prompts, email copy, status values, and Drive folders to match your business process."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "70b1fded-2ad5-4dc4-ae44-d615ae6fd291", "name": "Section 1 - Approved offers", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [784, 0], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 3200, "height": 180, "content": "## 1. Generate and send approved customer quotes\\nTurns a `FREIGEGEBEN` sheet row into quote text, a PDF, a Drive link, and a customer email."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "e7da768e-59f4-4237-a646-45712e039d74", "name": "Section 2 - Incoming requests", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [784, 784], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 2860, "height": 180, "content": "## 2. Capture and structure incoming quote requests\\nLoads Gmail messages, reads optional PDF attachments, and extracts structured project data."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "fa6fb01c-b51c-475e-937e-da08b7368bcc", "name": "Section 3 - Supplier request creation", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [3168, 1520], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 900, "height": 180, "content": "## 3. Create supplier price requests from specifications\\nIf the attachment is a bill of quantities/specification, prepare and store a supplier request for review."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "d14357cd-766f-4c8b-bb43-aad9d5f551cc", "name": "Section 4 - Send supplier requests", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [784, 2032], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 900, "height": 180, "content": "## 4. Send approved supplier price requests\\nWatches the supplier-request sheet, sends approved requests by Gmail, and updates the status."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "e731583d-ee30-4a92-8f73-266b62eb1845", "name": "Section 5 - Supplier responses", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [2160, 2032], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 1160, "height": 180, "content": "## 5. Extract and store supplier responses\\nReads supplier replies, extracts commercial terms with OpenAI, and stores each offer for comparison."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "a5c01eb0-b044-4b5e-95f0-107b71b9bb1b", "name": "Section 6 - Compare supplier offers", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [2832, 2560], "parameters": {"color": 7, "width": 1600, "height": 180, "content": "## 6. Compare supplier offers and write back the result\\nOnce at least two offers exist, OpenAI compares them and updates the comparison and source sheets."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "webhook-automata-injected-1791111459423", "name": "Automata Webhook", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", "position": [0, 0], "webhookId": "4fFRyTELz6JN10ON", "parameters": {"path": "4fFRyTELz6JN10ON", "options": {}, "httpMethod": "POST", "responseCode": 200, "responseMode": "onReceived"}, "typeVersion": 1.1}]	{"Freigabe prüfen":{"main":[[{"node":"Angebotsdaten berechnen","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI Chat Model":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Angebotstext erstellen","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"PDF-Text auslesen":{"main":[[{"node":"PDF-Inhalt vorbereiten","type":"main","index":0}]]},"PDF-Anhang prüfen":{"main":[[{"node":"PDF-Text auslesen","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"PDF-Inhalt vorbereiten","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Angebote überwachen":{"main":[[{"node":"Freigabe prüfen","type":"main","index":0}]]},"PDF für E-Mail laden":{"main":[[{"node":"Angebot per E-Mail senden","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Angebots-PDF speichern":{"main":[[{"node":"PDF-Link zusammenführen","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Angebotstext erstellen":{"main":[[{"node":"Angebot zusammenfuehren","type":"main","index":0}]]},"PDF-Anhang vorbereiten":{"main":[[{"node":"PDF-Anhang prüfen","type":"main","index":0}]]},"PDF-Inhalt vorbereiten":{"main":[[{"node":"E-Mail und PDF zusammenführen","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Angebot zusammenfuehren":{"main":[[{"node":"Angebot in Tabelle aktualisieren","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Angebotsanfrage prüfen":{"main":[[{"node":"Bestehende Angebote abrufen","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Angebotsdaten berechnen":{"main":[[{"node":"Angebotstext erstellen","type":"main","index":0}]]},"E-Mail-Date