ows are re-evaluated.\\n- **Input Validation & Fallback:** Validates attendee email format and automatically creates cryptographic ticket IDs if omitted.\\n- **Dynamic QR Code Injection:** Compiles high-density verification QR codes via QuickChart API without external paid subscriptions.\\n- **Storage Hygiene:** Automatically purges temporary Google Docs after PDF conversion to prevent Drive storage pollution.\\n- **Bidirectional Sync:** Updates Google Sheets with `ISSUED` status, timestamp, and persistent PDF Drive view links."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "0da1c7da-153a-4d4e-9d76-1858c4136d9f", "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 1", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [304, 0], "parameters": {"color": 6, "width": 640, "height": 604, "content": "### 📥 1. Ingestion & Validation\\n**Triggers:** Real-time Google Sheets poll or Manual Test trigger.\\n**Processing:** Validates RFC 5322 email syntax, normalizes casing, verifies `STATUS` column, and constructs QR verification parameters."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "328f569a-6ad3-47f3-a86d-6381f6f55ff2", "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 2", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [992, 0], "parameters": {"color": 4, "width": 220, "height": 604, "content": "### 🛡️ 2. Idempotency Gate\\n**Filter:** Evaluates `is_already_issued` and `is_valid_email`.\\n- **True:** Proceeds to ticket generation.\\n- **False:** Diverts to Audit Log (skips duplicate processing)."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "7d6daf42-6d60-404c-906f-203d93a53078", "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 3", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [1232, 0], "parameters": {"color": 6, "width": 940, "height": 604, "content": "### 🎨 3. Doc Personalization & PDF Render\\n**Actions:**\\n1. Duplicates master Google Doc template.\\n2. Injects variables (`{{NAMA}}`, `{{EMAIL}}`, `{{TIKET}}`, `{{EVENT}}`, `{{TIER}}`, `{{DATE}}`).\\n3. Calls Google Docs API to insert QR code at designated index.\\n4. Compiles and downloads personalized document as binary PDF."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "d43030ca-ce9d-427a-bcb0-7e2ec28674b0", "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 4", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "position": [2192, 0], "parameters": {"color": 6, "width": 1000, "height": 604, "content": "### 🚀 4. Archiving, Dispatch & Hygiene\\n**Actions:**\\n1. Stores PDF in dedicated Drive folder.\\n2. Dispatches branded HTML email with PDF attachment via Gmail.\\n3. Deletes temporary working Google Doc.\\n4. Syncs `ISSUED` status & PDF link back to Google Sheets."}, "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "webhook-automata-injected-1791111459379", "name": "Automata Webhook", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", "position": [0, 0], "webhookId": "vrLBMBbG9ZPXajAw", "parameters": {"path": "vrLBMBbG9ZPXajAw", "options": {}, "httpMethod": "POST", "responseCode": 200, "responseMode": "onReceived"}, "typeVersion": 1.1}]	{"Mock Test Fixture":{"main":[[{"node":"Validate & Normalize Data","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Manual Test Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"Mock Test Fixture","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Google Sheets Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"Validate & Normalize Data","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Inject Dynamic QR Code":{"main":[[{"node":"Compile Document to PDF","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Compile Document to PDF":{"main":[[{"node":"Archive PDF to Google Drive","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Clone Ticket Doc Template":{"main":[[{"node":"Populate Ticket Placeholders","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Dispatch Ticket via Gmail":{"main":[[{"node":"Clean Up Temporary Google Doc","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Validate & Normalize Data":{"main":[[{"node":"Eligibility & Idempotency Gate","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Archive PDF to Google Drive":{"main":[[{"node":"Dispatch Ticket via Gmail","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Populate Ticket Placeholders":{"main":[[{"node":"Inject Dynamic QR Code","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Clean Up Temporary Google Doc":{"main":[[{"node":"Update Sheet Ticket Status","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Eligibility & Idempotency Gate":{"main":[[{"node":"C